# Files NOT uploaded to production via deploy.sh
# (rsync --exclude-from format)

# Version control
.git/
.github/
.gitignore
.gitattributes

# OS / editors
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/
.claude/

# Source materials (not for serving)
# Leading slash anchors at deploy root — a bare `assets/` matched at ANY depth and
# was silently excluding cube-preview-a7f39c2b/assets/ (the cube's own images) too.
/assets/
Рендера/
Планування/
червень/
# Monthly photo drops arrive as Cyrillic month-named folders at the repo root
# ("липень - лайквю"). Match by month-name prefix so any suffix the client adds is
# covered. NOTE: patterns deliberately stop before any composable letter — see the
# NFD warning below; a pattern containing "й" (лютий, лайквю) written here in NFC
# silently fails to match, so "люти*" replaces "лютий*".
січень*/
люти*/
березень*/
квітень*/
травень*/
липень*/
серпень*/
вересень*/
жовтень*/
листопад*/
грудень*/
# Architect's raw deliverables. MUST stay excluded: this folder holds the client's
# source model (Квартира.glb) and the proprietary BIMx container — without these lines
# rsync uploads both to prod, where they become publicly downloadable.
# The web-ready derivative is built from here into img/3d/ by tools/build-glb.mjs.
#
# ⚠️ THREE patterns on purpose — one is not enough. macOS stores filenames in Unicode
# NFD (decomposed): the "й" in "новий" is on disk as "и" + U+0306, so a plain NFC
# pattern below silently fails to match and the .bimx WAS still being uploaded
# (verified with `rsync -avn`, 2026-07-15). "концепт" has no composable characters,
# so `*концепт/` matches under either normalisation. `*.bimx` is the ASCII backstop.
новий концепт/
*концепт/
*.bimx

# (root-level /*.jpg is excluded with the other dev snapshots further down)

# Build-only tooling (not served)
/tools/
/node_modules/
/package.json
/package-lock.json

# Dev prototype folder — the prod artifact is the mirrored /cube-preview-a7f39c2b/,
# not this. Without excluding it, deploy leaks hero-cube.html, apartment-tour.html
# and the internal BIMX-INTEGRATION.md / ART-DIRECTION.md notes to prod.
/concept/
# Monthly photo source drops (Cyrillic-named originals at repo root, pre-processing)
/*-source/
/*_source/

# Internal planning / docs (not for serving)
# Use leading slash to anchor at deploy root only — without it, `plans/`
# would also match `img/plans/` and clobber floor plan images.
/plans/
/progress/
/specs/
/thoughts/
/.planning/

# Local development artifacts
.playwright-mcp/
*.log
node_modules/
.tmp/
tmp/

# Old screenshots / dev snapshots in repo root
# Leading slash anchors these to the deploy root only — img/**/*.jpg is unaffected.
/*.png
/*.jpg
/*.jpeg
/*.bak
/audit.md
/ig-*.yml
/text*.txt

# Experimental versions
index-v*.html
index-v*.bak

# Image source originals
img/plans/_orig/
img/plans/commercial/_pdf-source/
img/plans/commercial/_manifest.json

# Deploy artifacts (don't deploy themselves)
deploy.sh
.deployignore
.deploy-env
.deploy-env.example
.env
.env.*

# Documentation (not user-facing) — /*.md covers root docs incl. the Cyrillic
# КОНЦЕПТ-Vygoda-Cube-Hero.md that leaked to prod root in a deploy dry-run.
/*.md
README.md
CLAUDE.md
icons/README.md

# Example configs only useful for devs
api/config.example.php

# Local rate-limit cache + log
logs/rate/
logs/submissions.log

# Misc
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
